From adae61383b87aa8321a92ed61fe624b405348623 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James <spadent@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:25:11 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] sdl1: sound and timing report, Sound Buffer setting

Every 10 s stderr gets how many frames ran late or were dropped and what
the sound card callback met: calls, short reads (gaps) and their size,
backlog thrown away, and the longest wait between callbacks; the device
the sound opened as is logged once. 'Sound Buffer' (ms) in linapple.conf
asks for a larger device buffer for a machine that stutters.
---
